graph LR
    Recruiter["Recruiter"]
    Providers["Email / SMS Providers"]
    Reply["Reply / Inbound Ingestion"]
    Tasks["Manual Task Service (LinkedIn)"]
    API["Campaign & Enrollment API"]
    Notifier["Notifications"]
    Scanner["Scanner / Scheduler"]
    PG[("Postgres: enrollment state")]
    Queue[["Message Queue (events)"]]

    Providers -.->|reply / STOP| Reply
    Reply -->|status = stopped| PG
    Reply -.->|reply.received| Queue
    Recruiter -->|pause / edit / mark status| API
    API -->|new version / state| PG
    Recruiter -->|complete task| Tasks
    Tasks -.->|task.completed| Queue
    Queue -.->|events| Scanner
    Scanner -->|advance / halt cursor| PG
    Queue -.->|job done / failures| Notifier
    Notifier -->|alert| Recruiter
